<LegalPage lang="en" page="cookies" title="Cookie policy" description="Information about cookies and local storage on the RESUELVE INTELLECT website." updated="17/11/2026">
  <h2>What we use</h2>
  <p>This website does not use advertising or third-party tracking cookies. It only uses essential technical storage and, if you accept, anonymous analytics.</p>
  <h3>Technical (exempt from consent)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>ri-consent-v1</strong> (localStorage) — stores your cookie choice. Persistent until you delete it.</li>
    <li><strong>ri-journey</strong> (sessionStorage) — remembers during the session the demos you tried and your calculator result so they can be included in your request if you submit the form. Deleted when you close the tab.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> — if enabled, anti-spam verification of the form. Required for security.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Analytics (only with your consent)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Plausible Analytics</strong> — if configured, aggregated, anonymous visit measurement without cookies or personal identifiers. Only loaded if you click "Accept".</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How to change your choice</h2>
  <p>You can change your consent at any time via the "Cookie settings" link in the footer, or by clearing site data in your browser.</p>
</LegalPage>
